<p id="S4.F8.pic12.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F8.pic12.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:39.7pt;"><img src="2509.14104v1/segmentation_748_result_v014.8.png" id="S4.F8.pic12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:55/55;" width="55" height="55" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
